OL,3,GNEWSAFitness became an addiction that
OL,4,Aleft me anxious and sleep deprived
OL,5,
OL,6,FA runner says he became so consumed by
OL,7,Fa fitness addiction that he spiralled
OL,8,Finto anxiety and became sleep deprived.
OL,10,FWayne Davies said he was left
OL,11,F"constantly worrying" about race times,
OL,12,Ftraining plans and fitness data and
OL,13,Fcomparing himself to other runners on
OL,14,Fsocial media.
OL,16,FThe 40-year-old said it felt like the
OL,17,F"rug was being pulled from under my
OL,18,Ffeet", before he was signposted to NHS
OL,19,FWales where he was able to regain
OL,20,Fcontrol.
